those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000093","name":"Seasoned Construction — Carpentry — Universal","type":"text","sort":12200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Seasoned Construction</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Universal</p><p>Wooden item ignores normal warping/weathering and gains +10% item HP.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000094","name":"Light Frame — Carpentry — Universal","type":"text","sort":12300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Light Frame</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Universal</p><p>Reduce Bulk by 1 where the wooden frame is a meaningful portion of the item.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000095","name":"Precision Joinery — Carpentry — Universal","type":"text","sort":12400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Precision Joinery</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Universal</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to checks to Repair, maintain or operate its crafted mechanism.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000096","name":"Reinforced Limb — Carpentry — Universal","type":"text","sort":12500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reinforced Limb</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Universal</p><p>Bow/crossbow/wooden weapon gains +1 damage per damage die against objects and structures.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000097","name":"Modular Frame — Carpentry — Universal","type":"text","sort":12600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Modular Frame</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Universal</p><p>One approved wooden component can be swapped during daily preparations without rebuilding the entire item.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000098","name":"True Fletching — Carpentry — Warbowyer","type":"text","sort":12700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>True Fletching</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Warbowyer</p><p>Ignore the first range-related environmental penalty from ordinary wind; ammunition can carry the artisan&#39;s identifying fletch.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000099","name":"Specialist Ammo Chamber — Carpentry — Warbowyer","type":"text","sort":12800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Specialist Ammo Chamber</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Warbowyer</p><p>Weapon can use one additional approved specialist ammunition family without modification.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000100","name":"Longshot Construction — Carpentry — Warbowyer","type":"text","sort":12900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Longshot Construction</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Warbowyer</p><p>Increase range increment by 50%; first range increment beyond normal maximum does not impose an additional penalty.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000101","name":"Rapid Mechanism — Carpentry — Warbowyer","type":"text","sort":13000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Rapid Mechanism</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Warbowyer</p><p>Once per round reduce one reload action by 1 action, minimum 0; if already reload 0, instead gain +1 Artisan bonus to first Strike after reloading.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000102","name":"Perfected Tension — Carpentry — Warbowyer","type":"text","sort":13100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfected Tension</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Warbowyer</p><p>Ranged weapon gains +1 attack beyond Core progression. Does not stack with another Over-Potency effect.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4; Core-tier Anchor required</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000103","name":"Warbow Overdraw — Carpentry — Warbowyer","type":"text","sort":13200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Warbow Overdraw</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Warbowyer</p><p>Ranged weapon gains +1 additional base weapon damage die beyond Core progression; on a natural 1, wielder becomes off-guard until start of next turn from the violent recoil/tension.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4; Core-tier Anchor required</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000104","name":"Builder's Mark — Carpentry — Masterwright","type":"text","sort":13300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Builder&#39;s Mark</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Masterwright</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to identify structural weaknesses or repair methods in wooden construction.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000105","name":"Reinforced Frame — Carpentry — Masterwright","type":"text","sort":13400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reinforced Frame</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Masterwright</p><p>Structure or wooden vehicle gains +20% HP and +2 Hardness.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>structure</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000106","name":"Rapid Assembly — Carpentry — Masterwright","type":"text","sort":13500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Rapid Assembly</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Masterwright</p><p>Reduce qualifying construction or field-fortification time by 30%.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000107","name":"Modular Construction — Carpentry — Masterwright","type":"text","sort":13600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Modular Construction</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Masterwright</p><p>Structure can be dismantled/reconfigured while recovering 80% of ordinary materials; temporary field works can be deployed in half normal time.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>structure</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000108","name":"Grand Design — Carpentry — Masterwright","type":"text","sort":13700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Grand Design</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Masterwright</p><p>Kingdom project using this design reduces one recurring Lumber/repair cost by 25% and gains +2 Artisan bonus to its primary construction check.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>project</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000109","name":"Citadel Framework — Carpentry — Masterwright","type":"text","sort":13800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Citadel Framework</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Masterwright</p><p>Major fortification counts as one category tougher for structural damage and grants defenders +1 Artisan bonus to checks/saves against forced entry, siege movement and collapse effects.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000110","name":"Carved Grip — Carpentry — Warcarving","type":"text","sort":13900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Carved Grip</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Warcarving</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to checks to resist Disarm or losing grip of the carved item.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000111","name":"Wolf Carving — Carpentry — Warcarving","type":"text","sort":14000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Wolf Carving</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Warcarving</p><p>After hitting a creature, gain +5 ft Speed when moving toward that creature until end of turn.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000112","name":"Bear Carving — Carpentry — Warcarving","type":"text","sort":14100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Bear Carving</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Warcarving</p><p>While wielding/raising item, gain resistance to physical damage equal to half Core Tier, rounded up; doubles against forced-movement damage.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000113","name":"Serpent Carving — Carpentry — Warcarving","type":"text","sort":14200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Serpent Carving</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Warcarving</p><p>Weapon gains one approved flexible/reach-style property; once/round after a successful Strike, Step 5 ft without triggering reactions from that target.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000114","name":"Spirit Carving — Carpentry — Warcarving","type":"text","sort":14300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Spirit Carving</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Warcarving</p><p>Item houses a totem spirit; once/encounter activate for 1 minute to gain +1 Artisan bonus to attack or AC chosen when crafted plus a themed sense/movement benefit.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000115","name":"Totemic Ascendance — Carpentry — Warcarving","type":"text","sort":14400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Totemic Ascendance</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Warcarving</p><p>Choose Wolf, Bear, Serpent or Stag each daily preparation; item gains that totem&#39;s Major-level package for the day, without consuming additional Capacity.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000116","name":"Stonebound — Stonemasonry — Universal","type":"text","sort":14500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Stonebound</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Universal</p><p>+1 Hardness and +10% item/structure HP.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000117","name":"Perfect Foundation — Stonemasonry — Universal","type":"text","sort":14600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfect Foundation</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Universal</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to checks to stabilise or repair a structure using this work.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>structure</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000118","name":"Anchored Construction — Stonemasonry — Universal","type":"text","sort":14700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Anchored Construction</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Universal</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus against forced movement/toppling; structures count as one size larger for such effects.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>structure</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000119","name":"Load-Bearing Cut — Stonemasonry — Universal","type":"text","sort":14800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Load-Bearing Cut</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Universal</p><p>Increase structure/stone-component HP by 20%.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000120","name":"Resonant Stone — Stonemasonry — Universal","type":"text","sort":14900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Resonant Stone</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Universal</p><p>Component gains one `ward`, `arcane-anchor` or equivalent approved tag for compatible specialist work.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000121","name":"Mason's Seal — Stonemasonry — Megalithics","type":"text","sort":15000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Mason&#39;s Seal</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Megalithics</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to identify damage, load paths and original construction methods in stone works.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000122","name":"Enduring Monument — Stonemasonry — Megalithics","type":"text","sort":15100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Enduring Monument</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Megalithics</p><p>Structure gains +25% HP and +2 Hardness.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>structure</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000123","name":"Grand Foundation — Stonemasonry — Megalithics","type":"text","sort":15200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Grand Foundation</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Megalithics</p><p>Structures built on this foundation gain +2 Artisan bonus against collapse, subsidence and siege movement; repairs restore 25% more HP.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>structure</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000124","name":"Civic Wonder — Stonemasonry — Megalithics","type":"text","sort":15300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Civic Wonder</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Megalithics</p><p>Assign one Kingdom purpose at creation—Culture, Defence, Trade, Faith or Infrastructure—and grant a strong project bonus agreed for that subsystem.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>structure</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000125","name":"Imperial Work — Stonemasonry — Megalithics","type":"text","sort":15400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Imperial Work</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Megalithics</p><p>Major structure reduces one related Kingdom resource cost by 25% and counts as a landmark/wonder for prestige and strategic effects.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>structure</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000126","name":"World-Rooted Foundation — Stonemasonry — Megalithics","type":"text","sort":15500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>World-Rooted Foundation</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Megalithics</p><p>Structure cannot be moved or toppled by ordinary effects and gains resistance to siege/structural damage equal to 3 × Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>structure</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000127","name":"Inscribed Keystone — Stonemasonry — Runemasonry","type":"text","sort":15600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Inscribed Keystone</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Runemasonry</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to identify/repair the ward and clearly marks ownership or purpose to authorised users.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000128","name":"Sentinel Rune — Stonemasonry — Runemasonry","type":"text","sort":15700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Sentinel Rune</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Runemasonry</p><p>Ward detects a chosen creature/type crossing its boundary and alerts designated recipients within the site.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000129","name":"Sanctuary Ward — Stonemasonry — Runemasonry","type":"text","sort":15800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Sanctuary Ward</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Runemasonry</p><p>Allies in a 20-ft zone gain +1 Artisan bonus to saves and temp HP equal to Core Tier when they first enter each encounter.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000130","name":"War Rune — Stonemasonry — Runemasonry","type":"text","sort":15900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>War Rune</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Runemasonry</p><p>Defenders in a 20-ft zone gain +1 Artisan bonus to attack rolls and damage equal to Core Tier on first successful Strike each round.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000131","name":"Fortress Sigil — Stonemasonry — Runemasonry","type":"text","sort":16000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Fortress Sigil</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Runemasonry</p><p>Large warded area suppresses hostile teleportation/forced planar entry unless attacker succeeds at a counteract/check against the ward&#39;s DC.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000132","name":"Dominion Ward — Stonemasonry — Runemasonry","type":"text","sort":16100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Dominion Ward</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Runemasonry</p><p>Choose one hostile creature family or supernatural theme; within the ward they take a -1 Artisan penalty to attacks/saves and cannot benefit from concealment against authorised defenders.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000133","name":"Titanic Fit — Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry","type":"text","sort":16200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Titanic Fit</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry</p><p>Ignore 1 Bulk of a stone component for encumbrance while properly worn/wielded.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000134","name":"Anchored — Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry","type":"text","sort":16300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Anchored</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus against forced movement, Trip and Reposition while using the item; count as one size larger for those effects where allowed.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000135","name":"Earthshaker — Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry","type":"text","sort":16400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Earthshaker</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry</p><p>Once/round on a critical hit or successful Shield Block, adjacent enemy must save or become off-guard and knocked 5 ft; critical failure also prone.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>shield</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000136","name":"Mountain Plate — Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry","type":"text","sort":16500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Mountain Plate</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry</p><p>Worn armour grants physical resistance equal to Core Tier and Max HP equal to 4 × Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000137","name":"Mountain-Blood Plate — Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry","type":"text","sort":16600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Mountain-Blood Plate</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry</p><p>Worn armour grants Max HP equal to 8 × Core Tier and physical resistance equal to 2 × Core Tier. Does not stack with another Max-HP Artisan Mark.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000138","name":"Living Colossus — Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry","type":"text","sort":16700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Living Colossus</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute increase size by one category, gain +5 ft reach, +2 Artisan bonus to Athletics and physical resistance equal to Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000139","name":"Perfect Clarity — Glassmaking — Universal","type":"text","sort":16800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfect Clarity</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Universal</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to visual Perception checks made through the crafted optic.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000140","name":"Hardened Glass — Glassmaking — Universal","type":"text","sort":16900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Hardened Glass</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Universal</p><p>Glass component gains +2 Hardness and +20% HP.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000141","name":"Arcane Lens — Glassmaking — Universal","type":"text","sort":17000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Arcane Lens</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Universal</p><p>Item gains `arcane`, `optic`, `conductor` tags for compatible specialist Marks.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000142","name":"Precision Focus — Glassmaking — Universal","type":"text","sort":17100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Precision Focus</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Universal</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to one approved ranged measurement/surveying check using the item.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000143","name":"Shatter Safe — Glassmaking — Universal","type":"text","sort":17200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Shatter Safe</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Universal</p><p>First time per day the glass component would be destroyed, it instead remains at 1 HP.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000144","name":"Calibrated Lens — Glassmaking — Prismcraft","type":"text","sort":17300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Calibrated Lens</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Prismcraft</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to visual Perception and range-estimation checks made through the optic.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000145","name":"Focusing Lens — Glassmaking — Prismcraft","type":"text","sort":17400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Focusing Lens</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Prismcraft</p><p>Ranged weapon/focus increases first range increment by 25%; spell focus gains +10 ft to one approved non-area range category.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000146","name":"Spectrum Prism — Glassmaking — Prismcraft","type":"text","sort":17500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Spectrum Prism</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Prismcraft</p><p>Choose two energy types at creation; once per round when dealing one, convert up to half the bonus energy damage to the other.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000147","name":"Beam Splitter — Glassmaking — Prismcraft","type":"text","sort":17600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Beam Splitter</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Prismcraft</p><p>Once/encounter after a ranged Strike or single-target item activation hits, repeat 50% of its bonus damage/effect against a second target within 15 ft of the first.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000148","name":"Trueglass Crown — Glassmaking — Prismcraft","type":"text","sort":17700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Trueglass Crown</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Prismcraft</p><p>Wearer gains constant see-invisibility-style perception within 30 ft and +2 Artisan bonus to checks/saves against visual illusions and concealment.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000149","name":"Crown Prism — Glassmaking — Prismcraft","type":"text","sort":17800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Crown Prism</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Prismcraft</p><p>Spellcasting focus gains +1 spell attack and spell DC beyond Core progression. Does not stack with another Over-Potency effect; requires T5+ optical core/component.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4; Core-tier Anchor required</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000150","name":"Perfect Reflection — Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft","type":"text","sort":17900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfect Reflection</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft</p><p>Mirror retains flawless clarity and grants +1 Artisan bonus to visual identification or disguise checks using it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000151","name":"Truth Mirror — Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft","type":"text","sort":18000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Truth Mirror</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to checks to detect visual disguises, glamours and shape-changing seen in the mirror.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000152","name":"Reflective Ward — Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft","type":"text","sort":18100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reflective Ward</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft</p><p>Reaction once/encounter when targeted by a spell attack: gain +2 Artisan bonus to AC against it; if the attack critically misses, redirect a reduced version at an eligible target within 30 ft.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>reaction</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000153","name":"Doppelglass — Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft","type":"text","sort":18200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Doppelglass</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft</p><p>Once/encounter create a reflected duplicate until start of next turn, granting concealed against the next attack that targets you.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000154","name":"Gate Mirror — Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft","type":"text","sort":18300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Gate Mirror</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft</p><p>Pair with another crafted Gate Mirror; once/day transport willing creatures through the linked mirrors subject to GM-set distance/Kingdom infrastructure limits.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>project</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000155","name":"Mirror Lord — Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft","type":"text","sort":18400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Mirror Lord</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute, first hostile spell or ranged magical effect each round targeting wearer can be contested with a counteract-style check; success negates, critical success reflects it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000156","name":"Stable Cell — Glassmaking — Aetherglass","type":"text","sort":18500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Stable Cell</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Aetherglass</p><p>Stored magical charge does not decay under ordinary downtime/environmental conditions.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000157","name":"Mana Reservoir — Glassmaking — Aetherglass","type":"text","sort":18600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Mana Reservoir</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Aetherglass</p><p>Item gains 1 charge/day usable by one listed custom activation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000158","name":"Arcane Conductor — Glassmaking — Aetherglass","type":"text","sort":18700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Arcane Conductor</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Aetherglass</p><p>Increase one magical damage/healing effect generated by the item by +1 die; if effect has no dice, increase fixed value by 25%.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000159","name":"Overflow Channel — Glassmaking — Aetherglass","type":"text","sort":18800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Overflow Channel</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Aetherglass</p><p>Once/encounter overcharge one activation: +50% range or +1 damage/healing die, but item loses 1 additional charge if it has charges.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000160","name":"Crystal Matrix — Glassmaking — Aetherglass","type":"text","sort":18900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Crystal Matrix</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Aetherglass</p><p>Reduce the Capacity cost of one compatible Enchanting or Azlanti Artifice Mark on the same item by 1, minimum 1; the item still cannot exceed the Capacity granted by its Core Tier unless another explicit effect raises that maximum.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000161","name":"Eternity Cell — Glassmaking — Aetherglass","type":"text","sort":19000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Eternity Cell</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Aetherglass</p><p>Item gains 3 charges/day and recovers 1 expended charge the first time each encounter the wearer critically succeeds at a relevant attack/save/activation check.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000162","name":"Hardened Ceramic — Pottery — Universal","type":"text","sort":19100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Hardened Ceramic</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Universal</p><p>+1 Hardness and +10% item HP.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000163","name":"Thermal Craft — Pottery — Universal","type":"text","sort":19200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Thermal Craft</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Universal</p><p>Container/component safely handles extreme mundane heat/cold.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000164","name":"Sealed Vessel — Pottery — Universal","type":"text","sort":19300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Sealed Vessel</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Universal</p><p>Contents do not leak, evaporate or contaminate through ordinary damage until the vessel is Broken.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000165","name":"Shock-Fired — Pottery — Universal","type":"text","sort":19400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Shock-Fired</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Universal</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus against effects that would shatter or rupture the ceramic item.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000166","name":"Nested Chamber — Pottery — Universal","type":"text","sort":19500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Nested Chamber</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Universal</p><p>Creates one concealed internal compartment or secondary reagent chamber.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000167","name":"Fired Seal — Pottery — Ceramancy","type":"text","sort":19600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Fired Seal</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Ceramancy</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to identify or repair the ceramic component and its maker&#39;s construction pattern.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000168","name":"Ceramic Plate — Pottery — Ceramancy","type":"text","sort":19700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Ceramic Plate</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Ceramancy</p><p>Armour component gains +2 Hardness and +15 HP per Core Tier without increasing Bulk.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000169","name":"Living Clay — Pottery — Ceramancy","type":"text","sort":19800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Living Clay</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Ceramancy</p><p>At start of wearer&#39;s turn, repair the item itself for HP equal to Core Tier if it is not Destroyed.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000170","name":"Terracotta Guardian — Pottery — Ceramancy","type":"text","sort":19900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Terracotta Guardian</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Ceramancy</p><p>Once/day animate a small guardian/figurine for 10 minutes; use a GM-approved creature profile appropriate to item tier, primarily defensive/support focused.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000171","name":"Adaptive Ceramic — Pottery — Ceramancy","type":"text","sort":20000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Adaptive Ceramic</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Ceramancy</p><p>Once/round when struck by physical damage, choose bludgeoning/piercing/slashing; gain resistance equal to 2 × Core Tier against that type until start of next turn.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000172","name":"Living Ceramic Shell — Pottery — Ceramancy","type":"text","sort":20100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Living Ceramic Shell</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Ceramancy</p><p>Worn armour grants regenerating temp HP equal to 2 × Core Tier at start of each turn if wearer has none; also repairs itself for same amount.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000173","name":"Sanctified Vessel — Pottery — Reliquarycraft","type":"text","sort":20200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Sanctified Vessel</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Reliquarycraft</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to checks to identify the contained essence and prevents ordinary spiritual leakage.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000174","name":"Essence Vessel — Pottery — Reliquarycraft","type":"text","sort":20300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Essence Vessel</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Reliquarycraft</p><p>Safely stores one harvested supernatural essence for later crafting without degradation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000175","name":"Bound Spirit — Pottery — Reliquarycraft","type":"text","sort":20400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Bound Spirit</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Reliquarycraft</p><p>House one willing/controlled spirit; item can grant one minor sense, Lore or once/day guidance effect tied to that spirit.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000176","name":"Sealed Curse — Pottery — Reliquarycraft","type":"text","sort":20500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Sealed Curse</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Reliquarycraft</p><p>Contain one curse/hazard effect; while sealed it cannot spread normally and grants +2 Artisan bonus to counteract/manage it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000177","name":"Release Matrix — Pottery — Reliquarycraft","type":"text","sort":20600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Release Matrix</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Reliquarycraft</p><p>Once/day deliberately discharge stored essence as a powerful item activation appropriate to the source; vessel then requires recharging/refilling.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000178","name":"Grand Reliquary — Pottery — Reliquarycraft","type":"text","sort":20700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Grand Reliquary</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Reliquarycraft</p><p>Safely maintain up to three compatible essences and switch the active one during daily preparations; once/day combine two for one Synergy-style activation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000179","name":"Heatproof Glaze — Pottery — Pyroceramics","type":"text","sort":20800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Heatproof Glaze</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Pyroceramics</p><p>Container/component ignores ordinary heat damage and gains +2 Artisan bonus against thermal breakage.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000180","name":"Thermal Crucible — Pottery — Pyroceramics","type":"text","sort":20900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Thermal Crucible</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Pyroceramics</p><p>When used by another artisan processing heat-sensitive material, reduce material loss by 10%.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000181","name":"Fragmenting Casing — Pottery — Pyroceramics","type":"text","sort":21000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Fragmenting Casing</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Pyroceramics</p><p>Increase bomb/splash item&#39;s splash radius by 5 ft and splash damage by Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000182","name":"Shaped Charge — Pottery — Pyroceramics","type":"text","sort":21100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Shaped Charge</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Pyroceramics</p><p>Explosive item can trade splash radius for force: against one target/object deal +1 damage die per two Core Tiers, rounded up.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000183","name":"Pressure Vessel — Pottery — Pyroceramics","type":"text","sort":21200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Pressure Vessel</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Pyroceramics</p><p>Increase one explosive/alchemical item&#39;s primary damage by 50%; on a critical crafting failure during manufacture, complication severity is increased.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000184","name":"Furnace Heart — Pottery — Pyroceramics","type":"text","sort":21300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Furnace Heart</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Pyroceramics</p><p>Once/day emit a 15-ft thermal eruption dealing 2d6 fire per Core Tier, basic Reflex save; item remains a qualifying portable forge/crucible for relevant downtime work.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000185","name":"Lightweave — Weaving — Universal","type":"text","sort":21400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Lightweave</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Universal</p><p>Reduce Bulk by 1 for primarily textile equipment.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000186","name":"Perfect Thread — Weaving — Universal","type":"text","sort":21500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfect Thread</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Universal</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to the next Tailoring/Leatherworking check using this textile as a component.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000187","name":"Reinforced Weave — Weaving — Universal","type":"text","sort":21600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reinforced Weave</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Universal</p><p>Textile item/component gains +20% HP and +1 Hardness.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000188","name":"Weatherproof Weave — Weaving — Universal","type":"text","sort":21700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Weatherproof Weave</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Universal</p><p>Wearer ignores ordinary rain/wind exposure and gains +1 Artisan bonus against severe weather.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000189","name":"Tensioned Thread — Weaving — Universal","type":"text","sort":21800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Tensioned Thread</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Universal</p><p>Rope, bowstring, net or sail gains +2 Artisan bonus to checks involving load, restraint or structural tension.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000190","name":"Resonant Thread — Weaving — Aetherweaving","type":"text","sort":21900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Resonant Thread</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Aetherweaving</p><p>Textile gains `mana`, `conductor`, `aetherwoven` tags and +1 Artisan bonus to checks to identify its magic.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000191","name":"Manaweave — Weaving — Aetherweaving","type":"text","sort":22000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Manaweave</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Aetherweaving</p><p>Worn item gains resistance to one chosen magical energy type equal to Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000192","name":"Spellthread — Weaving — Aetherweaving","type":"text","sort":22100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Spellthread</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Aetherweaving</p><p>Store one approved spell/effect in the garment, usable once/day at an item rank appropriate to Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000193","name":"Ethereal Weave — Weaving — Aetherweaving","type":"text","sort":22200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Ethereal Weave</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Aetherweaving</p><p>Wearer ignores difficult terrain from non-magical ground and once/encounter Steps 10 ft through occupied spaces without triggering reactions.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000194","name":"Expanded Matrix — Weaving — Aetherweaving","type":"text","sort":22300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Expanded Matrix</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Aetherweaving</p><p>Reduce one compatible Enchanting/Tailoring Mark&#39;s Capacity cost by 1, minimum 1; finished item still has hard maximum 8 Capacity.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000195","name":"Aetherbound Form — Weaving — Aetherweaving","type":"text","sort":22400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Aetherbound Form</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Aetherweaving</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute garment becomes semi-ethereal: fly Speed 20 ft, resistance to physical damage equal to Core Tier, and wearer can squeeze through openings as though one size smaller.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000196","name":"Warcloth Finish — Weaving — Ironweaving","type":"text","sort":22500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Warcloth Finish</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Ironweaving</p><p>+10% textile component HP and +1 Artisan bonus to checks against tearing/cutting.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000197","name":"Impact Mesh — Weaving — Ironweaving","type":"text","sort":22600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Impact Mesh</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Ironweaving</p><p>Worn gear grants resistance 1 to physical damage per two Core Tiers, rounded up.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000198","name":"Flexible Weave — Weaving — Ironweaving","type":"text","sort":22700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Flexible Weave</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Ironweaving</p><p>Reduce one armour movement penalty by 5 ft and improve one Dex-cap-style campaign limitation by +1 where applicable.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000199","name":"Shock-Absorbing Warcloth — Weaving — Ironweaving","type":"text","sort":22800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Shock-Absorbing Warcloth</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Ironweaving</p><p>At start of each turn, if wearer has no temp HP, gain temp HP equal to Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000200","name":"Silken Steel — Weaving — Ironweaving","type":"text","sort":22900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Silken Steel</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Ironweaving</p><p>Worn armour gains +1 AC beyond Core progression and physical resistance equal to Core Tier; does not stack with another Artisan AC-over-Core effect.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4; Core-tier Anchor required</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000201","name":"Unbreakable Braid — Weaving — Ironweaving","type":"text","sort":23000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Unbreakable Braid</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Ironweaving</p><p>Worn item grants Max HP equal to 6 × Core Tier; ropes/nets/structural textiles instead gain +100% HP and +5 Hardness.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000202","name":"Heraldic Seal — Weaving — Heraldweaving","type":"text","sort":23100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Heraldic Seal</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Heraldweaving</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to social checks proving authority, affiliation or military identity represented by the standard.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000203","name":"Unbroken Standard — Weaving — Heraldweaving","type":"text","sort":23200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Unbroken Standard</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Heraldweaving</p><p>Allies within 20 ft gain +1 Artisan bonus to saves against fear while the banner is displayed.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000204","name":"Marching Banner — Weaving — Heraldweaving","type":"text","sort":23300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Marching Banner</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Heraldweaving</p><p>Allies beginning turn within 20 ft gain +5 ft status-equivalent movement for that turn and ignore first 5 ft of difficult terrain.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000205","name":"King's Colours — Weaving — Heraldweaving","type":"text","sort":23400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>King&#39;s Colours</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Heraldweaving</p><p>Allies within 20 ft gain +1 Artisan bonus to saves against mental effects and +1 to Aid checks involving coordinated action.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000206","name":"Conqueror's Standard — Weaving — Heraldweaving","type":"text","sort":23500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Conqueror&#39;s Standard</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Heraldweaving</p><p>Once/encounter for 1 minute, allies in 30 ft gain +1 Artisan bonus to attack rolls after they reduce an enemy to 0 HP; bonus lasts until end of their next turn.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000207","name":"Sovereign Standard — Weaving — Heraldweaving","type":"text","sort":23600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Sovereign Standard</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Heraldweaving</p><p>30-ft aura: allies gain +1 Artisan bonus to saves and damage equal to Core Tier on first hit each round; once/day aura also grants temp HP equal to 3 × Core Tier when activated.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000208","name":"Perfect Index — Bookmaking — Universal","type":"text","sort":23700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfect Index</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Universal</p><p>Find a known entry in the work immediately rather than spending extended search time.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000209","name":"Preserved Knowledge — Bookmaking — Universal","type":"text","sort":23800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Preserved Knowledge</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Universal</p><p>Book/map/formula resists ordinary water, age and environmental damage.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000210","name":"Master Copy — Bookmaking — Universal","type":"text","sort":23900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Master Copy</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Universal</p><p>Copying a formula/text from this master takes 50% less downtime.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000211","name":"Encoded Script — Bookmaking — Universal","type":"text","sort":24000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Encoded Script</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Universal</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to conceal or protect the text from unauthorised reading.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000212","name":"Reference Tabs — Bookmaking — Universal","type":"text","sort":24100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reference Tabs</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Universal</p><p>Once per 10 minutes, gain +1 Artisan bonus to one Recall Knowledge check using the work&#39;s documented subject.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000213","name":"Indexed Arcana — Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft","type":"text","sort":24200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Indexed Arcana</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to Recall Knowledge about spells recorded in the grimoire and instantly locate any known entry.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000214","name":"Mnemonic Pages — Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft","type":"text","sort":24300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Mnemonic Pages</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft</p><p>Once/day during preparation, swap one prepared/recorded spell choice of an appropriate rank without needing another full preparation period.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000215","name":"Resonant Chapter — Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft","type":"text","sort":24400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Resonant Chapter</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft</p><p>Choose one spell trait/theme; spells of that theme gain +1 Artisan bonus to damage/healing per spell rank or +1 to one associated counteract/check, chosen at creation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000216","name":"Spell Echo — Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft","type":"text","sort":24500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Spell Echo</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft</p><p>Once/encounter after casting a spell from/through the grimoire, repeat one non-damaging minor rider or 50% of bonus damage/healing against the same or a second valid target.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000217","name":"Archmage Codex — Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft","type":"text","sort":24600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Archmage Codex</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute choose one mode: +25% spell range, ignore resistance equal to Core Tier, or add +1 spell damage/healing die.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000218","name":"Endless Grimoire — Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft","type":"text","sort":24700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Endless Grimoire</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft</p><p>Once/day recover one expended spell slot or equivalent spell resource of a rank no higher than half Core Tier rounded up, subject to GM conversion for non-slot casters.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000219","name":"Scholar's Index — Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft","type":"text","sort":24800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Scholar&#39;s Index</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to research checks using the chronicle&#39;s documented subject.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000220","name":"Lore Codex — Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft","type":"text","sort":24900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Lore Codex</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft</p><p>After 10 minutes study, gain trained-equivalent access to one narrow Lore for 8 hours, or +1 Artisan bonus if already trained.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000221","name":"Crafting Manual — Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft","type":"text","sort":25000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Crafting Manual</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft</p><p>For one recipe/category, reduce crafting downtime by 20% and gain +2 Artisan bonus to the first project check each day.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000222","name":"Tactical Treatise — Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft","type":"text","sort":25100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Tactical Treatise</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft</p><p>After study, once/encounter gain +2 Artisan bonus to one attack, save or Recall Knowledge check against the documented enemy/tactic.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000223","name":"Master's Testament — Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft","type":"text","sort":25200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Master&#39;s Testament</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft</p><p>After daily study, gain temporary access to one approved feat/technique for which you meet level prerequisites until next preparations.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000224","name":"Legendary Chronicle — Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft","type":"text","sort":25300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Legendary Chronicle</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft</p><p>During preparations choose one documented discipline; up to six readers gain +1 Artisan bonus to related skill checks and one once/day reroll in that discipline.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000225","name":"Surveyor's Mark — Bookmaking — Grand Cartography","type":"text","sort":25400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Surveyor&#39;s Mark</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grand Cartography</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to navigation and Reconnoiter-style checks in mapped territory.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000226","name":"Safe Passage — Bookmaking — Grand Cartography","type":"text","sort":25500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Safe Passage</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grand Cartography</p><p>Party reduces non-combat travel delay from known mundane hazards by 25% in mapped territory.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000227","name":"Resource Survey — Bookmaking — Grand Cartography","type":"text","sort":25600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Resource Survey</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grand Cartography</p><p>Map can reveal one hidden or underexploited resource site after successful survey; Kingdom extraction from it gains +1 project bonus.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>project</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000228","name":"Strategic Map — Bookmaking — Grand Cartography","type":"text","sort":25700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Strategic Map</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grand Cartography</p><p>Armies/parties using the map gain +1 Artisan bonus to initiative or strategic movement checks in the mapped region.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>project</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000229","name":"Hidden Paths — Bookmaking — Grand Cartography","type":"text","sort":25800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Hidden Paths</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grand Cartography</p><p>Discover or establish a secret route that reduces travel time by 25% and grants +2 Artisan bonus to avoid detection while using it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000230","name":"World Atlas — Bookmaking — Grand Cartography","type":"text","sort":25900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>World Atlas</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grand Cartography</p><p>Atlas magically updates known mapped holdings; once per Kingdom turn designate one mapped region to gain a strong temporary bonus to travel, resource extraction or settlement planning.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>project</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000231","name":"Perfect Fit — Tailoring — Universal","type":"text","sort":26000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfect Fit</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Universal</p><p>Reduce worn garment Bulk by 1 where sensible and remove minor fitting penalties.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000232","name":"Reinforced Seam — Tailoring — Universal","type":"text","sort":26100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reinforced Seam</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Universal</p><p>+10% garment HP and +1 Hardness.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000233","name":"Hidden Pocketing — Tailoring — Universal","type":"text","sort":26200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Hidden Pocketing</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Universal</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to conceal one appropriately sized carried object.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000234","name":"Quick-Access Cut — Tailoring — Universal","type":"text","sort":26300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Quick-Access Cut</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Universal</p><p>Once per round, draw one stored light object as part of the action used to activate/use it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000235","name":"Layered Lining — Tailoring — Universal","type":"text","sort":26400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Layered Lining</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Universal</p><p>Garment can accept one eligible secondary textile/leather component without increasing Bulk.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000236","name":"Combat Cut — Tailoring — Battlestitching","type":"text","sort":26500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Combat Cut</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Battlestitching</p><p>Reduce one minor worn-equipment movement/fitting penalty and +1 Artisan bonus to Acrobatics checks involving the garment&#39;s mobility.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000237","name":"Quickdraw Harness — Tailoring — Battlestitching","type":"text","sort":26600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Quickdraw Harness</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Battlestitching</p><p>Once per round, draw one secured light weapon/item as part of the action used to wield or activate it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000238","name":"Vital Reinforcement — Tailoring — Battlestitching","type":"text","sort":26700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Vital Reinforcement</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Battlestitching</p><p>While attuned to worn armour/garment, gain Max HP equal to 5 × Core Tier. Does not stack with another Max-HP Artisan Mark.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000239","name":"Reactive Weave — Tailoring — Battlestitching","type":"text","sort":26800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reactive Weave</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Battlestitching</p><p>Reaction once/round when damaged: reduce damage by Core Tier + 2; if attack was a critical hit, reduce by twice that amount.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>reaction</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000240","name":"War-Skin — Tailoring — Battlestitching","type":"text","sort":26900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>War-Skin</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Battlestitching</p><p>Worn armour gains +1 AC beyond Core progression, +5 ft Speed and physical resistance equal to Core Tier. Does not stack with another AC-over-Core effect.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4; Core-tier Anchor required</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000241","name":"War-Skin Regeneration — Tailoring — Battlestitching","type":"text","sort":27000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>War-Skin Regeneration</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Battlestitching</p><p>At start of each turn gain temp HP equal to 2 × Core Tier if you have none; if you took no damage since your previous turn, gain 3 × Core Tier instead.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000242","name":"Silent Stitch — Tailoring — Veilcraft","type":"text","sort":27100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Silent Stitch</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Veilcraft</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to Stealth checks where clothing noise would matter.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000243","name":"Chameleon Cloth — Tailoring — Veilcraft","type":"text","sort":27200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Chameleon Cloth</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Veilcraft</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to Hide/Sneak while stationary or moving at half Speed in a chosen environment palette.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000244","name":"Many-Faced Weave — Tailoring — Veilcraft","type":"text","sort":27300000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Many-Faced Weave</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Veilcraft</p><p>As a 1-minute adjustment, alter apparent clothing, silhouette and facial framing; gain +2 Artisan bonus to impersonation/disguise checks.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000245","name":"Shadow Mantle — Tailoring — Veilcraft","type":"text","sort":27400000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Shadow Mantle</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Veilcraft</p><p>Once/encounter for 1 minute gain concealment while in dim light or darkness; first successful Strike each round does not end it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000246","name":"Phase Veil — Tailoring — Veilcraft","type":"text","sort":27500000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Phase Veil</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Veilcraft</p><p>Once/encounter for 1 round become partially incorporeal: move through creatures, gain physical resistance equal to 2 × Core Tier and ignore difficult terrain.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000247","name":"Null Mantle — Tailoring — Veilcraft","type":"text","sort":27600000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Null Mantle</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Veilcraft</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute become invisible to mundane sight and gain +2 Artisan bonus against magical detection/counteract attempts; attacking suppresses invisibility until start of next turn.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000248","name":"Court Finish — Tailoring — Regaliacraft","type":"text","sort":27700000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Court Finish</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Regaliacraft</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to Society checks involving formal protocol, heraldry or court presentation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000249","name":"Envoy's Raiment — Tailoring — Regaliacraft","type":"text","sort":27800000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Envoy&#39;s Raiment</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Regaliacraft</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to Diplomacy when acting in an official recognised capacity.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000250","name":"Commander's Mantle — Tailoring — Regaliacraft","type":"text","sort":27900000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Commander&#39;s Mantle</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Regaliacraft</p><p>Allies within 15 ft gain +1 Artisan bonus to Aid and saves against fear while wearer is conscious and visibly acting as leader.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000251","name":"Judicator's Robes — Tailoring — Regaliacraft","type":"text","sort":28000000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Judicator&#39;s Robes</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Regaliacraft</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to Sense Motive and checks to detect deliberate lies or enforce formal authority; once/encounter designate one creature as under judgement, granting +1 to allies&#39; first save against it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000252","name":"Sovereign Presence — Tailoring — Regaliacraft","type":"text","sort":28100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Sovereign Presence</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Regaliacraft</p><p>30-ft aura for 1 minute once/encounter: allies gain +1 Artisan bonus to saves and enemies take -1 Artisan penalty to fear/mental saves against the wearer.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}},{"_id":"wmMark0000000253","name":"Coronation Regalia — Tailoring — Regaliacraft","type":"text","sort":28200000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Coronation Regalia</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Regaliacraft</p><p>While worn by the recognised office-holder, grant Max HP equal to 5 × Core Tier, +1 Artisan bonus to Diplomacy/Intimidation, and once/day give allies within 30 ft temp HP equal to 3 × Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Applies to</th><td>item</td></tr><tr><th>Activation</th><td>Passive or source-defined; unspecified action costs require GM adjudication</td></tr><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"},"ownership":{"default":2}}]}
